+which lesson is up next, who the teacher is, and how far you have got. The four lines at the bottom of the panel
+are the files it reads for real, one by one.
+
+**The diagram the teacher draws lands in the message stream** — not the name of a tool, an actual diagram:
+
+![The diagram the teacher drew in the message stream: program → process → CPU taking turns](demo/images/老师画的图出现在消息流里.png)
+
+**A lesson looks like this**: the teacher asks → the student answers (with a misconception) → the teacher rules
